  "details": "whenever a user is kicked or disconnects from a world without actively leaving they get stuck frozen in place and stay in the playerlist even if they rejoin, if someone joins after the user is kicked or disconnected then the user is shown at point 0,0,0 with loading above them.\n\nive tested it on android on the public build [1886] and pc on open beta [1896] and other people have told me it happens to them too and everyone in the instance sees it.\n\ni dont know what happens to the kicked/disconnected users but i dont think they can see their 'copy' when they rejoin [it stays for everyone else] but i dont know if kicking crashes them or something at the moment\n\nthis is easy to reproduce",
